k11s witness: the producers discriminate: a unit-stride read of A changes the result: true
k11s witness: the unscheduled form matches the host oracle: true
k11s witness: a matmul site whose row is the minor output axis, read at stride 2 and strictly taller than every output axis read at unit stride: true
k11s witness: the device's own limits seed both flavors: true
